    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "CAHERRUSH, QUILTY, CO. CLARE V95 H6T7                                          \r\nDETACHED COTTAGE C. 0.45 ACRES\r\n\r\nCOASTLINE PROPERTY WITH SHORELINE ACCESS AND AMAZING SEA VIEWS ON A QUIET CUL DE SAC ROAD \r\n \r\nA SHORT STROLL TO THE SHORELINE AND ATLANTIC OCEAN\r\n\r\nCOMPANY LICENCE 003178\r\n\r\nDESCRIPTION\r\nAt Streets Ahead Properties, we are delighted to bring to the market this 3-bedroom detached cottage on circa 0.45 acres, located on the outskirts of Quilty village a short stroll to the coastline, boasting stunning sea views in a quiet peaceful area. \r\nThis amazing property gives ample opportunity to enjoy coastal living at its best, boasting amazing sea views and access to the shoreline from the property. This property has recently undergone a refurbishment and insulation upgrade, bringing this property to excellent turnkey order.\r\n\r\nLocated on a local road just off the N67 main Spanish Point, Miltown Malbay and Quilty route, approximately a 2 minute drive to Quilty Village and 5.7 km to Seafield beach, 2.9 km from Spanish Point beach, 4.3 km from Miltown Malbay town and a 15 min drive from Doonbeg Golf links/hotel. Lahinch is approximately a 20 minute drive from the property famous for its sandy beach, Promenade walk and 18 hole Championship golf course.\r\n\r\nSpacious garden area to front, side and rear of the property. Private treatment percolation area and mains water.\r\n\r\nWalkway gate with footpath at front of house walled boundary, gate adjacent opens into the spacious green lawn at the side which extends around the property. Ideal off street parking space. Ample room to extend.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is comprised of an entrance hallway, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, 3 bedrooms, main shower room and hot press. Timber garden shed adjacent ideal for storage.\r\n\r\nAPPROXIMATE FLOOR AREA 62.61 sq. m.\r\nBER F\r\nYEAR CONSTRUCTED 1850\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION – APPROXIMATE DIMENSIONS:\r\n\r\nHallway: (2.35m x 0.86m) Timber flooring, pendant light point.\r\n    \r\nSitting room: (4.54m x 3.31m) Timber flooring, complete with an open fireplace, timber mantle, brick insert and tiled base, wallpapered chimney breast, pendant light point. The hotpress space is included in the overall dimensions. Front aspect.\r\n    \r\nKitchen /Dining room: (2.94m x 2.89m) Dual aspect, complete with timber flooring, electric 4 ring hob and cooker, washing machine, fitted wall and base units, ample work top space, sink and fridge freezer.\r\n     \r\nShower room: (2.91m x 1.75m) Fully tiled – mosaic base shower tile and complete with a wet shower space, electric shower, W.C, W.H.B. incorporating a vanity space underneath and ceiling spotlighting. Side aspect.\r\n \r\nBedroom 1: (4.42m x 2.89m) Spacious and bright double bedroom with dual aspect. Complete with timber flooring.\r\n     \r\nBedroom 2: (2.56m x 1.96m) Front aspect room complete with timber flooring, pendant light point.\r\n \r\nBedroom 3: (3.56m x 2.37m) Rear aspect room complete with timber flooring, pendant light point. Spacious room.\r\n     \r\nExternal\r\nFront boundary wall with walkway gate and front path leading to front door. Gate adjacent to the property allowing for off street parking and leading onto the spacious garden at side and rear of the house. Timber garden shed.\r\n\r\nNote: Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs are provided for guidance purposes only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "PROPERTY FEATURES\r\nShoreline access from the property.\r\nAmazing sea views.\r\nImpressive 3 bedroom cottage.\r\nAmple garden space, timber garden shed and off street parking.\r\nRecently refurbished and insulation upgraded.\r\nOil fired central heating, open fireplace and double glazed windows and doors.\r\nTurnkey order.\r\nIdeal coastal getaway.\r\nPeaceful surroundings.\r\nEase of access to Quilty, Spanish Point, Doonbeg, Miltown Malbay and Lahinch."
      },
